{title: Jaanewalon Zara}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Laxmikant Pyarelal}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
Jaane [A] waalo zara,        mud ke [D] dekho mujhe
Ek [E] insaan hun,        main [A] tumhari tarah,
Jis [A] ne sabko racha,        apne [D] hi roop se
Uski [E] pehchaaan hun,        main [A] tumhaaariee tarah
Jaanewaalo zara,        [A] Is aa [F#m] nokhe ja [A] gat
ki main [E] taqdeer [A] hun,        Main vi [F#m] dhaataa k [A] haatho ki
[E] tasveer [A] hun.        [A] Ek [E] tasveer [A] hun..
[A] Is jahaan ke liye,        dharti [D] maa ke liye
Shiv ka [A] vardaan hun,        main [A] tumhaariee tarah...
Jaanewaalo zara...        Man ke andar lagaaye milan ki lagan
Apne suraj se hoon, ek bichhdi kiran,        Ek bichhdi kiran
Rah raha hun bhatakta,        main yahaan se wahan
Aur pareshaan hun,        main tumhaarrii tarah..
Jaanewaaalon zara...
